WEBVTT

00:03.170 --> 00:05.880
D-dude. What's the deal with that group?

00:11.290 --> 00:13.920
It's like a hottie convention.

00:14.460 --> 00:16.630
So, what's the occasion?

00:16.630 --> 00:18.960
You hardly ever invite us out, Oyuki.

00:18.960 --> 00:20.710
Did something happen?

00:22.830 --> 00:25.380
Well, do you remember Planet Urchin?

00:25.380 --> 00:26.750
Planet Urchin?

00:26.750 --> 00:28.710
You mean the one with all those spikes?

00:28.710 --> 00:31.000
Yes, that's the one.

00:31.000 --> 00:32.880
They've apparently started to redevelop it.

00:33.080 --> 00:34.330
Oh really?

00:34.330 --> 00:35.500
Why's that?

00:35.500 --> 00:38.710
It's a barren planet with
nothing but calcium spikes.

00:38.710 --> 00:40.000
What could they use it for?

00:40.000 --> 00:43.630
As it turns out, they discovered
soil filled with high-protein amino acids

00:43.630 --> 00:46.380
lying underneath the calcium layer,

00:46.380 --> 00:49.540
so they're in the middle of doing
a large-scale excavation there.

00:50.630 --> 00:54.380
But what does Planet Urchin
have to do with us?

01:05.420 --> 01:06.710
W-wait!

01:06.710 --> 01:08.960
Are you saying this is about CAO-2?!

01:08.960 --> 01:11.630
It's only a matter of time
until he's discovered. Probably.

01:11.630 --> 01:14.210
Why didn't you start by telling us that?!

01:14.210 --> 01:16.500
Because I wanted to enjoy my tea first...

01:16.500 --> 01:18.920
This ain't the time to be
loafing around, dammit!

01:18.920 --> 01:20.540
What're we gonna do?!
I don't want any trouble!

01:20.540 --> 01:21.540
QUIT FREAKING OUT!

01:21.540 --> 01:22.880
YOU'RE THE ONLY ONE FREAKING OUT!

01:22.880 --> 01:23.880
It's fine!

01:23.880 --> 01:25.750
Nobody cares what happened years ago!

01:25.750 --> 01:28.670
Oh no... not CAO-2...
Shit! I didn't want to get dragged into this!<b></b>

01:36.750 --> 01:40.830
Trapped in an endless pitfall of love and crazy about you

01:40.830 --> 01:43.580
Don't let your eyes wander darling, that's a no-no

01:43.580 --> 01:46.960
Pain pain, fly away, until only love remains

01:46.960 --> 01:49.750
My heart is stirring with affection

02:01.000 --> 02:03.960
I hate being alone, just a touch is enough

02:03.960 --> 02:07.000
To be connected y'know, it's a nice feeling y'know

02:07.000 --> 02:10.040
The negative opinions of others don't matter

02:10.040 --> 02:13.130
Like the saying goes, love is blind

02:13.130 --> 02:16.790
I will never have the ultimate fashion sense

02:16.790 --> 02:20.170
Is it envy? Or misery? In this story

02:20.170 --> 02:22.830
Feelings communicated in mentions

02:22.830 --> 02:26.880
C'mon, I want it communicated in words

02:26.880 --> 02:31.000
Trapped in an endless pitfall of love and crazy about you

02:31.000 --> 02:33.670
Don't let your eyes wander darling, that's a no-no

02:33.670 --> 02:37.130
Pain pain, fly away, until only love remains

02:37.130 --> 02:39.500
Although it's also stressful

02:39.500 --> 02:42.710
Cheating and drowning in dreams

02:42.710 --> 02:45.960
There's no realistic romance anymore

02:46.170 --> 02:49.250
Trapped in a pitfall of love and crazy about you

02:49.250 --> 02:51.960
My heart is stirring with affection

02:52.170 --> 02:53.750
La la la la la

02:53.750 --> 02:55.210
Compulsive, I need you

02:55.210 --> 02:56.880
La la la la la

02:56.880 --> 02:58.210
Loneliness is a disease

02:58.210 --> 02:59.830
La la la la la

02:59.830 --> 03:01.380
Blind, I need you

03:01.380 --> 03:04.290
Now and forever, I wanna be crazy about you

03:06.960 --> 03:10.630
This is a story that takes place
a number of years ago.

03:12.500 --> 03:14.670
What you see before you
is the School Colony!

03:15.130 --> 03:17.670
It is an amalgamation of various
educational institutions,

03:17.670 --> 03:20.960
and where children from different planets
across the system come to attend school.

03:20.960 --> 03:24.500
In one sector of this colony is
Planet Elementary School.

03:24.500 --> 03:27.460
It is home to a legendary teacher.

03:27.630 --> 03:28.080
Clickety-clack, clickety-clack...

03:28.080 --> 03:32.040
He has a body of pure metal and
has worked for 200 consecutive years.
Clickety-clack, clickety-clack...<b></b>

03:32.330 --> 03:37.130
He is a robot teacher known for his
iron mentality and steel confidence!

03:37.670 --> 03:39.080
Try this on for size!

03:39.080 --> 03:41.000
Oh? That's how you're gonna play it?

03:41.000 --> 03:42.420
Clickety-clack.

03:42.420 --> 03:43.960
And his name is...

03:46.540 --> 03:49.670
CAO-2, THE COSMO TEACHER!

03:50.130 --> 03:52.830
Quiet down, everyone! Take your seats!

03:56.460 --> 03:58.790
All right. Time for roll call.

03:58.790 --> 04:00.420
Heck yeah! I win!

04:00.420 --> 04:02.920
See that, Ran?
I totally whooped her butt!

04:02.920 --> 04:04.170
N-not so loud...

04:04.170 --> 04:05.960
That one doesn't count!
Let's play again! One more time!

04:06.540 --> 04:07.540
Enough!

04:07.540 --> 04:09.080
You girls better start listening to me!

04:09.710 --> 04:11.540
Get in your seats now!

04:12.880 --> 04:15.710
<b>Cosmo Teacher</b>

04:12.880 --> 04:15.710
<b>CAO-2</b>

04:17.960 --> 04:18.920
Ha-ha!

04:18.920 --> 04:20.630
Look at the losers who got in trouble!

04:22.250 --> 04:23.420
Fudge!

04:23.420 --> 04:26.000
That stupid jerkface teacher!

04:28.380 --> 04:29.830
I hate CAO-2.

04:29.830 --> 04:32.750
I don't care if he's worked here
for 200 years or whatever.

04:32.750 --> 04:33.880
He's not the boss of me!

04:33.880 --> 04:36.080
We should give him
a taste of his own medicine!

04:36.080 --> 04:36.880
Yeah!

04:36.880 --> 04:38.960
Oh no. What are you going to do?

04:40.210 --> 04:44.000
Well, he's too tough to even flinch
unless we really lay it on him.

04:45.880 --> 04:48.080
Hey. Listen to me for a sec.

04:48.250 --> 04:49.170
Huh?

04:49.170 --> 04:50.170
What is it?

04:50.170 --> 04:52.210
First, we rig the door to the classroom...

04:52.210 --> 04:54.710
Whisper, whisper, whisper...

04:56.420 --> 04:57.420
<b>BABABABAM!</b>

04:56.420 --> 04:57.420
<b>VRRRRM!</b>

05:01.130 --> 05:01.920
All done!

05:02.130 --> 05:04.000
Perfect. Here goes!

05:05.380 --> 05:08.380
G-gosh, I'm not sure about this...

05:08.380 --> 05:09.580
It's ready to go!

05:09.580 --> 05:10.330
Okay.

05:10.330 --> 05:12.040
C'mon, let's haul it up!

05:13.630 --> 05:15.960
You're good! You're good!

05:16.170 --> 05:17.420
Stop!

05:19.460 --> 05:21.500
Sweet! That should do it!

05:21.750 --> 05:24.170
Guys? I don't think this is a good idea.

05:24.170 --> 05:25.630
We're gonna get in trouble again!

05:25.630 --> 05:27.630
It's too late to back out now!

05:29.500 --> 05:33.500
Get ready to feel the pain, CAO-2!

05:33.880 --> 05:39.170
Clickety-clack, clickety-clack, clickety-clack...

05:41.330 --> 05:42.750
Aw yeah, here he comes!

05:45.130 --> 05:46.540
Do it, sucker!

05:49.880 --> 05:51.420
<b>BOOOONK</b>

05:51.540 --> 05:54.960
Clickety-clack, clickety-clack...

05:55.210 --> 05:59.250
Clickety-clack, clickety-clack...

06:03.630 --> 06:06.250
How nice, it seems you're all
unusually quiet today!

06:06.250 --> 06:06.790
Yo, what the heck happened?

06:06.790 --> 06:07.330
Well, let's get started.
Yo, what the heck happened?<b></b>

06:07.330 --> 06:09.040
Well, let's get started.
He didn't feel a thing at all!<b></b>

06:09.250 --> 06:10.420
Everyone stand.

06:11.630 --> 06:12.630
And bow.

06:13.040 --> 06:14.420
<b>KAWHAM!</b>

06:17.000 --> 06:19.830
WHO'S RESPONSIBLE FOR THIS?!

06:21.580 --> 06:23.500
Owie, owie, owie...

06:23.500 --> 06:25.460
This is why I said you shouldn't do it.

06:25.460 --> 06:28.380
When the heck was that?!
You didn't do a darn thing to stop us!

06:28.380 --> 06:30.380
Oh? That's not what I remember...

06:30.380 --> 06:32.750
I told you guys it was a bad idea!

06:32.750 --> 06:34.040
Aw phooey!

06:34.040 --> 06:36.670
WHY DON'T YOU GUYS LISTEN TO ME?!

06:38.080 --> 06:40.500
Hard to believe you were all
such troublemakers.

06:40.500 --> 06:41.380
Huh?

06:41.380 --> 06:42.960
Darling? When did you get here?

06:42.960 --> 06:44.920
Wow, that's surprising.

06:44.920 --> 06:48.000
Even you were a little rascal back in
elementary school, huh, Miss Lum?

06:48.000 --> 06:50.380
Oh my.
Where did he come crawling out from?

06:50.630 --> 06:53.540
You know, I was actually
a good girl back then.

06:53.540 --> 06:55.460
The only reason I helped out
with all that mischief

06:55.460 --> 06:57.080
was because Lum ordered me to!

06:57.080 --> 06:59.000
Why do you always pin the blame on me?!

06:59.000 --> 07:00.960
Eeek! Save me, darling!

07:00.960 --> 07:01.960
I've got you, baby.

07:01.960 --> 07:03.630
Boo-hoo! Boo-hoo!
Stop it! Get away from him!<b></b>

07:03.830 --> 07:07.170
Come now, Ran. You should have just
spoken up and let them know how you felt.

07:07.170 --> 07:08.290
Totally.

07:08.290 --> 07:11.330
Oyuki was the only one of us
who kept her hands clean.

07:11.330 --> 07:13.080
Although she never tried to stop us...

07:13.710 --> 07:15.750
I'm not just gonna call it quits after that!

07:15.750 --> 07:17.580
Don't try and stop me, Oyuki!

07:18.880 --> 07:20.580
Are you ready, Lum?

07:20.580 --> 07:22.330
Yep! I'm raring to go!

07:22.330 --> 07:23.790
Guys, he's coming!

07:23.790 --> 07:27.000
Clickety-clack, clickety-clack...

07:27.380 --> 07:29.130
He's in for the shock of his life!

07:29.130 --> 07:31.080
Guys? Maybe we shouldn't do this...

07:31.330 --> 07:33.080
No way! Take this!

07:33.960 --> 07:35.250
Let 'er rip, Lum!

07:35.250 --> 07:36.210
Okay!

07:36.380 --> 07:38.130
<b>KAZAZAZAZAZAZAZAZAZAZAP!</b>

07:39.790 --> 07:40.920
Bet that hurt!

07:46.540 --> 07:48.330
Check it out! We fried his circuits!

07:48.330 --> 07:49.790
All according to plan!

07:49.790 --> 07:51.330
Eat dirt, sucker!

07:57.750 --> 07:59.630
Owie, owie, owie!

07:59.630 --> 08:01.630
See! I told you guys!

08:01.630 --> 08:04.580
Waaah! This sucks!
That jerkface! He totally fell on purpose!<b></b>

08:04.580 --> 08:05.830
Waaah! This sucks!
Don't be silly.<b></b>

08:05.830 --> 08:08.290
He was completely shorted out.

08:09.880 --> 08:11.750
That's quite a thrilling story.

08:12.040 --> 08:14.040
I advised them against doing it.

08:14.040 --> 08:15.960
No, you friggin' did not!

08:16.670 --> 08:19.830
If he was so tough, you should've just
launched a missile or something at him!

08:19.830 --> 08:21.130
We did.

08:22.130 --> 08:22.960
Wha?

08:22.960 --> 08:25.420
A missile. We shot one at him.

08:26.880 --> 08:29.580
Guys! I really don't wanna do this!

08:29.580 --> 08:32.080
We can't fire the missile unless
all three of us hold it up!

08:33.460 --> 08:33.830
He's doomed this time!

08:33.830 --> 08:35.080
Clickety-clack, clickety-clack...
He's doomed this time!<b></b>

08:35.080 --> 08:35.790
Clickety-clack, clickety-clack...

08:35.790 --> 08:37.580
Clickety-clack, clickety-clack...
Here he comes! Get ready!<b></b>

08:42.630 --> 08:46.210
Kiss your robo-butt goodbye, CAO-2!

08:47.290 --> 08:48.250
Open fire!

08:49.960 --> 08:51.580
<b>KABLOOOOOEY!</b>

08:51.750 --> 08:53.330
Right on target!

08:54.500 --> 08:55.710
Did that wipe him out?

08:57.580 --> 08:59.750
Clickety...

09:01.750 --> 09:04.000
NOT YOU BRATS AGAIN!

09:04.960 --> 09:07.960
I've had enough of your antics;
you won't get off easy today!

09:08.380 --> 09:09.750
He's tougher than nails!

09:09.750 --> 09:12.130
Oh poo. I haven't done anything.

09:12.130 --> 09:14.880
I never wanted to do it! I told you guys!

09:14.880 --> 09:17.540
COME HERE THIS INSTANT!

09:18.290 --> 09:19.330
Hey, look!

09:20.630 --> 09:21.710
It's an air bike!

09:21.710 --> 09:22.830
Everyone, get on it!

09:27.290 --> 09:29.500
There's no way he'd chase us this far out.

09:29.500 --> 09:31.500
NOT SO FAST!

09:31.500 --> 09:32.710
He's on our tail!

09:32.710 --> 09:35.080
I'll shake him! Everybody, hang tight!

09:39.500 --> 09:41.750
GET BACK HERE!

09:42.170 --> 09:43.290
He's going to catch us.

09:43.290 --> 09:45.580
Waaah! No more!

09:45.580 --> 09:46.460
I told you I didn't wanna do it!

09:46.460 --> 09:48.750
Benten! Do something!
I told you I didn't wanna do it!<b></b>

09:48.750 --> 09:49.880
Aw fudge!

09:50.210 --> 09:51.500
Look over there!

09:52.210 --> 09:53.580
It's Planet Urchin!

09:53.580 --> 09:56.000
Nice! We can lose him
somewhere in there!

09:56.330 --> 09:58.670
STOOOOOP!

10:00.790 --> 10:03.250
I SAID STOOOOP!

10:03.250 --> 10:05.750
We're doomed! He's gonna hit us!

10:05.750 --> 10:07.500
HANG ON!

10:07.710 --> 10:08.750
<b>RAMMO!</b>

10:09.460 --> 10:11.130
U-uh oh...

10:13.460 --> 10:14.420
We did it!

10:14.420 --> 10:15.710
He's totally stuck!

10:16.130 --> 10:18.000
Argh! I can't move!

10:19.250 --> 10:21.460
Serves you right, CAO-2!

10:21.460 --> 10:23.380
We've got him beat this time!

10:24.670 --> 10:27.540
See you never, CAO-2!

10:27.540 --> 10:29.750
H-hey! Stop right there!

10:30.540 --> 10:32.080
Aw crap.

10:32.080 --> 10:34.750
Hey! You little whelps!

10:35.040 --> 10:36.460
You haven't seen the last of me yet!

10:36.460 --> 10:38.250
Whew, that was a close one.
You haven't seen the last of me yet!<b></b>

10:38.250 --> 10:39.000
Whew, that was a close one.

10:43.500 --> 10:46.630
Planet Urchin is a deserted planet
out on the fringes of space.

10:46.630 --> 10:49.290
No one would ever know
if we didn't say anything.

10:49.290 --> 10:51.920
Hold up. You just left him there like that...?

10:51.920 --> 10:54.210
He's definitely going to come punish us.

10:54.210 --> 10:55.710
You think so?

10:55.710 --> 10:58.330
Actually, I remembered something...

10:58.330 --> 11:01.460
You little whelps!
You haven't seen the last of me yet!

11:01.460 --> 11:04.380
I'll make sure you get disciplined for this!

11:04.380 --> 11:06.790
He sounded real sure of himself.

11:07.130 --> 11:09.540
Oh please. That was so long ago.

11:09.540 --> 11:11.500
I'm certain he's forgotten all about it.

11:13.710 --> 11:15.420
Y-yeah, that's right!

11:17.460 --> 11:20.250
Hold on! It doesn't matter if we
think it's in the past,

11:20.250 --> 11:22.580
because he probably
still remembers it like yesterday!

11:22.580 --> 11:23.750
And if he gets free...

11:26.500 --> 11:28.920
You little whelps...

11:28.920 --> 11:30.580
CAO-2!

11:30.580 --> 11:31.670
W-wait!

11:31.670 --> 11:32.250
<b>SMASH!</b>

11:32.420 --> 11:33.210
<b>SMASH!</b>

11:33.330 --> 11:34.330
<b>SMASH!</b>

11:36.960 --> 11:38.790
Wh-what the hell was that thing?

11:38.790 --> 11:41.290
It kinda looked like a giant
blackboard eraser to me...

11:43.500 --> 11:44.500
That bastard!

11:44.750 --> 11:47.670
Same old teacher.
Nothing's changed about him.

11:47.670 --> 11:49.290
Why did I get hit too...?

11:49.880 --> 11:51.290
He got us good.

11:52.380 --> 11:56.750
SHIT! THIS IS WHY I TOLD YOU GUYS
I DIDN'T WANNA DO IT!

12:00.750 --> 12:02.500
That felt good.

12:23.750 --> 12:25.130
It's finished.

12:27.420 --> 12:28.960
Pardon me a moment.

12:29.500 --> 12:31.210
Oh, Lady Ryoko!

12:31.210 --> 12:33.540
Does my brother happen to still be awake?

12:33.540 --> 12:34.880
Yes, ma'am. I believe...

12:34.880 --> 12:36.580
he's currently reading a book.

12:38.000 --> 12:39.290
Dear brother!

12:40.630 --> 12:43.500
Oh jeez, Ryoko.
What's with that crazy getup?

12:43.500 --> 12:45.580
I'm just trying to set the mood.

12:46.040 --> 12:49.040
For you see, I was making a voodoo doll.

12:49.040 --> 12:52.130
You have the most bizarre hobbies, I swear.

12:52.130 --> 12:54.040
Look, dear brother.

12:55.290 --> 12:56.580
Isn't it adorable?

12:58.960 --> 13:00.630
Y-you wouldn't dare!

13:00.960 --> 13:05.130
As sharp as ever, my dear brother.
Nothing gets by you!

13:05.420 --> 13:06.460
<b>SNAP!</b>

13:08.880 --> 13:10.960
Just hand over the doll, nice and easy!

13:10.960 --> 13:11.710
Oh my!

13:11.710 --> 13:12.750
Or else- wah!

13:12.210 --> 13:12.750
<b>SNAP!</b>

13:13.080 --> 13:16.080
H-how could you turn a sword on
your own younger sister?!

13:16.420 --> 13:17.710
YOU'LL PAY FOR THAT!

13:17.710 --> 13:19.500
CUT IT OUT!

13:19.500 --> 13:22.420
<b>Ooh, Scary! Voodoo Doll</b>

13:23.500 --> 13:25.330
It has so much power...

13:25.960 --> 13:27.210
Goodness me,

13:27.210 --> 13:31.290
I'm starting to fear I've created something
that shouldn't have been trifled with.

13:32.040 --> 13:34.830
Just sitting here and looking at it makes me...

13:35.330 --> 13:36.830
want to do stuff like this!

13:36.830 --> 13:38.420
Wah! Hot! Hot! Hot!

13:38.630 --> 13:40.080
And stuff like this!

13:40.830 --> 13:41.920
Young Master...?

13:42.330 --> 13:43.960
A-and even things like this...!

13:43.960 --> 13:45.290
Are you okay?!
Ow! Ow! Ow!<b></b>

13:45.290 --> 13:45.920
Ow! Ow! Ow!

13:46.330 --> 13:48.460
I'm terrified that I can't control myself!

13:49.380 --> 13:51.460
Young Master! Young Master!

13:53.210 --> 13:56.000
Oh! Whatever shall I do?!

13:56.330 --> 13:57.790
I'm at a loss!

13:59.250 --> 14:01.830
Wait, I know! I'll give it to him.

14:02.250 --> 14:05.130
There will be no problems
if I give it to that gentleman.

14:05.130 --> 14:07.670
I just know I can trust him with it!

14:07.670 --> 14:09.960
He has such an honest heart,

14:09.960 --> 14:12.210
and always acts with such kindness!

14:12.750 --> 14:14.830
<b>The Gentleman</b>

14:15.210 --> 14:17.040
So, I just need to hold on to this doll?

14:17.040 --> 14:17.920
Yessir!

14:17.920 --> 14:19.880
We cannot explain the details.

14:19.880 --> 14:21.790
Just know that she would like
you to keep it safe

14:21.790 --> 14:23.790
and carry it on your person at all times.

14:24.170 --> 14:25.330
All right.

14:25.830 --> 14:28.250
I dunno what the deal is, but roger that!

14:28.250 --> 14:30.080
Your cooperation is appreciated.

14:30.080 --> 14:31.290
Just leave it to me!

14:34.000 --> 14:40.380
"If he got wet, he transformed into a girl."

14:40.630 --> 14:41.290
That accursed Ryoko.

14:41.290 --> 14:42.080
"Throw hot water at him..."
That accursed Ryoko.<b></b>

14:42.080 --> 14:44.420
"Throw hot water at him..."
Her crazy creations always cause me trouble.<b></b>

14:44.920 --> 14:46.630
Please rest assured!

14:46.630 --> 14:49.460
I left the doll in the safest place
that I could think of.

14:49.460 --> 14:52.330
She tried to play it off,
but I know Ryoko better.

14:52.330 --> 14:53.710
The situation remains dire.

14:53.710 --> 14:54.580
Mendo!

14:55.580 --> 14:56.880
U-uh, yessir?

14:56.880 --> 14:58.710
Go on. You read the next part.

14:59.540 --> 15:03.000
"When his dad got wet,
he transformed into a panda..."

15:02.500 --> 15:03.000
<b>JAB</b>

15:03.290 --> 15:04.460
<b>STING...</b>

15:04.540 --> 15:06.500
Wh-what's wrong, Mendo?!

15:08.540 --> 15:10.960
Nothing... I'm fine...

15:12.210 --> 15:14.130
Warm up with 10 pushups.

15:14.130 --> 15:15.250
Start!

15:15.380 --> 15:18.250
Pushups are the basis for
all sorts of exercises.

15:18.380 --> 15:20.130
This is very bad.

15:20.500 --> 15:23.210
Something is clearly happening to that doll.

15:23.210 --> 15:25.960
But where the hell did Ryoko put it?

15:27.460 --> 15:29.710
It sucks how much it gets in the way.

15:29.710 --> 15:32.710
But I gotta keep this doll from Ryoko with me!

15:32.710 --> 15:34.460
What's wrong, Moroboshi?

15:34.460 --> 15:37.210
I don't see those arms moving.
You giving up?

15:37.460 --> 15:38.580
N-no!

15:39.210 --> 15:40.500
How pathetic.

15:43.250 --> 15:44.790
Crap, I'm at my limit!

15:45.830 --> 15:48.540
Good thing I'm fit. My daily training
really pays off in times lik-

15:48.290 --> 15:49.540
<b>WHOMP!</b>

15:48.670 --> 15:49.960
<b>WHOMP!</b>

15:49.960 --> 15:51.460
Aw jeez, you gotta be kidding me!

15:51.460 --> 15:53.380
Keep it together, you two!

15:53.790 --> 15:55.210
<b>CLASS 2-4</b>

15:57.670 --> 16:01.080
Don't tell me...
Moroboshi has the doll?!

16:03.250 --> 16:05.580
Hey, Shinobu!
You smell extra nice today!

16:05.580 --> 16:08.170
Oh, you noticed?
I changed my shampoo!

16:08.170 --> 16:11.540
You really have sharp senses
when it comes to things like that, huh?

16:11.540 --> 16:14.210
Of course! That's because
I'm super into you, baby.

16:14.210 --> 16:16.210
Oh please! Don't even start, Ataru!

16:16.380 --> 16:17.210
<b>WHAP!</b>

16:20.880 --> 16:23.210
What're you doing up there, Mendo?

16:24.420 --> 16:26.080
Oh, nothing.

16:28.250 --> 16:30.670
Please no... not him...!

16:31.250 --> 16:32.380
Darling!

16:32.380 --> 16:35.290
Just quit fooling around with Shinobu
and you won't get hurt like that!

16:36.330 --> 16:37.710
What's that supposed to mean?

16:39.330 --> 16:43.000
KAZAZAZAZAZAZAZAZAZAZAP!

16:45.130 --> 16:48.960
There's no doubt about it.
Moroboshi has the voodoo doll.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.040
And what's more...

16:50.330 --> 16:53.000
he appears to have no idea
what it really is.

16:53.000 --> 16:55.250
He'd be doing far worse if he did.

16:55.540 --> 16:57.710
Argh! The pain!

16:59.420 --> 17:02.380
I have to get it back
without him noticing.

17:02.380 --> 17:03.790
Ryu, sweetie!

17:05.290 --> 17:08.380
Oh hey.
Did you change your shampoo, too?

17:05.290 --> 17:10.580
<b>SHUDDER</b>

17:08.380 --> 17:10.580
You smell so nice.

17:10.580 --> 17:13.630
What the hell, man?!
You're always such a friggin' creep!

17:13.710 --> 17:15.380
<b>BIFF!</b>

17:15.630 --> 17:17.170
M-Mendo...?

17:17.790 --> 17:19.710
<b>Awwww....</b>

17:19.170 --> 17:20.630
Did Mendo just...

17:20.630 --> 17:21.880
...cover for Ataru?

17:22.330 --> 17:23.460
Moroboshi.

17:23.460 --> 17:25.830
Try and keep yourself
out of harm's way, okay?

17:25.830 --> 17:26.580
Sure.

17:26.580 --> 17:27.830
The hell does that mean?

17:27.830 --> 17:29.630
Thank you, Shutaro!

17:29.630 --> 17:31.380
I'm so happy you protected my darling!

17:31.380 --> 17:32.630
It was nothing!

17:34.130 --> 17:37.630
Crud. It's too risky to let Moroboshi
out of my sights for even a second.

17:39.330 --> 17:41.040
Huh? Where did Moroboshi go?

17:41.040 --> 17:42.420
Oh, he just left.

17:42.420 --> 17:44.290
He went up to the roof to play
some volleyball.

17:44.290 --> 17:46.540
DAMMIT! QUIT BOUNCING
ALL OVER THE PLACE!

17:46.540 --> 17:47.420
Hup!

17:49.040 --> 17:50.670
I got it, I got it!

17:53.670 --> 17:55.080
Come to papa!

17:56.790 --> 17:59.250
WATCH OOOOOOOUT!

17:59.540 --> 18:01.040
<b>FWAP!</b>

18:08.170 --> 18:09.540
What the?!

18:12.000 --> 18:13.080
Hey, Mendo!

18:13.080 --> 18:14.380
You okay, man?!

18:15.750 --> 18:18.130
Dude. I can't believe you did that.

18:18.130 --> 18:20.130
Wh-what about Moroboshi...?

18:20.670 --> 18:22.540
Is Moroboshi okay?

18:22.540 --> 18:24.630
No worries. He's fit as a fiddle.

18:24.630 --> 18:26.420
Th-that's good...

18:26.790 --> 18:28.250
What a relief.

18:28.920 --> 18:32.040
Mendo... you're a stand-up guy...

18:32.330 --> 18:34.630
<b>Awwww....</b>

18:33.540 --> 18:35.790
I didn't know you cared so much.

18:36.040 --> 18:38.460
Mo... Moroboshi...

18:39.630 --> 18:42.210
<b>GROPE</b>

18:42.040 --> 18:43.880
What're you doing? Quit feeling me up!

18:43.040 --> 18:43.880
<b>SLAM!</b>

18:45.460 --> 18:47.460
I figured that's where it was!

18:47.460 --> 18:49.170
Man, you are hard to figure out.

18:49.170 --> 18:51.040
First you save me,
then you point a sword at me!

18:51.040 --> 18:52.250
SHUT YOUR FACE!

18:52.250 --> 18:54.170
Give me what you have
in your chest pocket right now,

18:54.170 --> 18:55.830
if you want to live to see another day!

18:55.830 --> 18:57.130
F-fine then.

18:57.420 --> 18:59.460
I don't know what the deal is, but...

18:59.670 --> 19:00.500
Here.

19:00.670 --> 19:03.040
I NEVER SAID ANYTHING ABOUT
YOUR WALLET, STUPID!

19:03.210 --> 19:05.500
I want the straw doll that you have
stuffed under your shirt!

19:05.500 --> 19:06.710
Give it to me right now!

19:06.710 --> 19:08.000
Straw doll?

19:08.380 --> 19:09.380
You mean this thing?

19:09.380 --> 19:11.580
Yes! That's it!
That's exactly what I want!

19:11.580 --> 19:13.250
I'd rather die than give you this!

19:13.250 --> 19:15.630
It's a special treasure
that I'm keeping for Ryoko!

19:15.630 --> 19:16.920
Oh yeah?

19:16.920 --> 19:18.290
All right.

19:19.380 --> 19:21.130
Then it's time to die.

19:21.130 --> 19:22.750
Whoa, I never said I wouldn't give it to you!

19:22.750 --> 19:24.170
Just tell me what's going on first...

19:24.170 --> 19:26.790
IF I WANTED TO TELL YOU,
I WOULD HAVE DONE IT ALREADY, DAMMIT!

19:26.960 --> 19:27.920
<b>SWOOP!</b>

19:27.290 --> 19:28.250
Actually...

19:28.710 --> 19:29.880
Whisper...

19:29.880 --> 19:31.670
Whisper, whisper.

19:32.040 --> 19:35.080
I see. So that's what's going on.

19:35.750 --> 19:36.750
Mendo!

19:37.250 --> 19:38.580
You're such a bonehead.

19:38.580 --> 19:39.790
Huh?

19:39.790 --> 19:42.670
Why didn't you just tell us the truth
from the get-go?!

19:42.670 --> 19:44.880
You know we're all classmates
who respect each other here!

19:45.540 --> 19:47.420
M-Moroboshi...

19:47.420 --> 19:50.130
If only I'd known what it really was,
then I could have...

19:50.830 --> 19:52.420
...done this sooner!

19:58.290 --> 20:00.790
This is payback for all the shit
you put me through!

20:04.380 --> 20:06.880
Moroboshi!

20:09.830 --> 20:13.130
Mark my words, you'll rue this day!

20:13.670 --> 20:17.670
Moroboshi...!

20:24.170 --> 20:25.790
Moroboshi.

20:26.710 --> 20:30.080
What's up, Mendo?
Didja come for another taste of pain?

20:33.540 --> 20:34.670
N-no way!

20:34.670 --> 20:37.580
Yes way! It's a voodoo doll of you!

20:37.580 --> 20:39.580
Now it's my turn! Take this!

20:39.580 --> 20:41.460
Go on! Suffer!

20:41.460 --> 20:43.460
If that's how you wanna play it...

20:43.460 --> 20:44.630
then take this!

20:46.170 --> 20:49.460
Too bad! I'm already used to that
after yesterday's fiasco!

20:49.960 --> 20:52.290
Now it's a contest to see
who gives up first!

20:52.290 --> 20:53.420
Fine by me!

20:53.420 --> 20:55.920
Please don't, Mendo!
It's too dangerous!

20:55.920 --> 20:57.250
You can do it, darling!

20:57.250 --> 20:58.290
EAT THIS!

21:00.130 --> 21:01.250
OUCH!

21:01.250 --> 21:03.880
Owww! That stings!

21:03.880 --> 21:05.380
Time for round two!

21:05.380 --> 21:07.000
Like hell it is!

21:07.960 --> 21:09.170
<b>KAWHAM!</b>

21:10.830 --> 21:11.670
Ouch!

21:11.670 --> 21:13.580
Talk about a totally pointless fight.

21:13.580 --> 21:15.080
Yeah, no kidding.

21:15.080 --> 21:15.920
The pain!

21:16.540 --> 21:19.460
It's not enough, I want more love

21:19.460 --> 21:22.460
I can't imagine myself with anyone other than you

21:22.460 --> 21:25.210
So fall for me and look only at me

21:25.210 --> 21:28.210
I already love you even down to your marrow

21:39.380 --> 21:42.380
Deep in those eyes, who are you waiting for?

21:42.380 --> 21:45.330
All you've shown me is your face from the side

21:45.330 --> 21:46.750
I want to know

21:46.750 --> 21:49.080
Give me love, give me love, that's all

21:50.880 --> 21:53.960
Out of every planet it was Earth that I came to

21:53.960 --> 21:56.790
Because your presence drew me to it

21:56.790 --> 21:59.000
I want you to respond, to the vagueness

21:59.000 --> 22:00.080
To I need you

22:00.080 --> 22:01.330
I wanna solve the complication

22:01.330 --> 22:02.880
I want shared love

22:02.880 --> 22:04.540
C'mon c'mon, darling darling

22:04.540 --> 22:05.920
Even if we get separated

22:05.920 --> 22:07.420
C'mon c'mon, darling darling

22:07.420 --> 22:08.710
At the ends of the universe

22:08.710 --> 22:11.210
Just sew the stars and moon together

22:11.210 --> 22:13.210
And draw them close

22:13.210 --> 22:14.170
After all

22:14.170 --> 22:16.880
It's not enough, I want more love

22:16.880 --> 22:19.830
I can't imagine myself with anyone other than you

22:19.830 --> 22:22.670
So fall for me and look only at me

22:22.670 --> 22:25.500
I already love you even down to your marrow

22:25.500 --> 22:28.420
No way no way, don't run off somewhere

22:28.420 --> 22:31.250
I want to revolve around the planet known as you

22:31.250 --> 22:34.170
Hey look this way, then look that way

22:34.170 --> 22:37.290
In spite of everything, I'm just so in love with you

22:37.500 --> 22:38.960
Absolutely, absolutely

22:38.960 --> 22:40.330
I'll give you a shock

22:40.330 --> 22:41.880
Enough, enough

22:41.880 --> 22:43.290
Not enough love

22:46.000 --> 22:50.920
<b>Big Bottle, Little Bottle</b>

22:46.000 --> 22:50.920
<b>When Love Strikes</b>

22:46.750 --> 22:48.630
On the next episode of "Urusei Yatsura"!

22:48.630 --> 22:49.750
Bark!
